  "holistic_F_N": 0,
  "holistic_F_H": 0,
  "section_notes": "S1 mandates 24-hour reporting of all incidents and prompt customer notice, even without confirmed cause. S2 keeps a 5% test failure threshold but allows sales to continue under corrective action rather than an automatic ban. S3 requires remote shut-off for new units and a retrofit deadline of at least six years; S4 requires built-in suppression within 36 months; S5 sets an 8/100k trigger for risk assessment with discretionary recall and corrective action."
